    "work_id": "scripture/asv/nah",
    "canonical_ref": "Nah.1.12",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Thus saith Jehovah: Though they be in full strength, and likewise many, even so shall they be cut down, and he shall pass away. Though I have afflicted thee, I will afflict thee no more.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": -620,
    "date_range": [
      -663,
      -612
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/nah#Nah.1.13",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/nah",
    "canonical_ref": "Nah.1.13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And now will I break his yoke from off thee, and will burst thy bonds in sunder.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": -620,
    "date_range": [
      -663,
      -612
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/asv/nah#Nah.1.14",
    "work_id": "scripture/asv/nah",
    "canonical_ref": "Nah.1.14",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And Jehovah hath given commandment concerning thee, that no more of thy name be sown: out of the house of thy gods will I cut off the graven image and the molten image; I will make thy grave; for thou art vile.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": -620,
    "date_range": [
      -663,
      -612
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
